OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fmainly cloud with further showers.
OL,7,FOvernight as a northerly breeze
OL,8,Fdevelops the showers wil become more
OL,9,Ffocused across North Highland Lewis
OL,10,Fand Harris, with southern areas
OL,11,Fbecoming mainly dry.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FA cool and rather cloudy day
OL,14,Fwith occasional showers, more frequent
OL,15,Facross the north. A few sunny
OL,16,Fintervals. Moderate northerly breeze
OL,17,Fin coastal areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
