OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFriday
OL,6,Fcool, mostly cloudy but dry. Some
OL,7,Fearly sun on Saturday then cloudier
OL,8,Fwith scattered light showers. Sunday
OL,9,Fcloudy with some light rain,
OL,10,Ffreshening southwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
